17:       solo: 'You thank {name} for trusting you with the truth. You do not promise a romance you cannot give. She looks a little sad, then smiles with relief.\n\nThe three islanders watch you leave together as friends, free to write their own next chapters. You sail toward the mainland beneath a sky full of unfamiliar stars. Choosing honestly is its own kind of kindness.'
